Federated DSH includes controlled build-time compatibility adaptations of
DeepSeek Harness 0.1.1-rc.2 source from:

  https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness
  Commit: b150a551b8d465e31e418e1b2eaf5e79bbb7d28e
  License: MIT

The adapted surfaces are limited to an extracted Workspace/Session node subtree
and a singleton Connection /api middleware seam. Source, patch and output
identities are recorded under the governing OpenSpec change. Generated upstream
bundles are not committed.

Architecture and incident patterns were reviewed from:

  dsh-session-hub
  https://github.com/Asaiuta/dsh-session-hub
  Commit reviewed: fef18684e2112c2546f6098fd8aaf6e289126b95
  License: MIT

No source from dsh-session-hub is copied. Its exact-route rollback, event-stream
routing and reconnect incidents informed independent tests; its bare-ID,
virtual-workspace, ssh2 and credential-sync architecture is not adopted.
